00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:19.960
Stupid construction.
I wish they'd finish already.

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:23.840
Once the event starts, it'll be worse
with all the traffic restrictions.

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:28.130
Watching it on TV is good enough.

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:32.070
My parents are saying
they're definitely gonna go.

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:49.490
But, won't tickets be hard to get?

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:52.280
They'll be real expensive
with all the scalpers.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:01.000
There's better ways to use that money.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:05.070
Huh?

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:06.730
Kazuki?

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:08.740
CHAPTER 3

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:13.760
TANTANBO'S YOKAI CASTLE

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:18.020
There's a strange rumor going around
among the kids recently.

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:21.190
Did we get a letter?

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:23.650
No. Mana sent this.

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:28.460
-<i>"A strange rumor is going around."</i>
-<i>"Oh-ho."</i>

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:28.530
Mana-chan, huh?
You two have gotten close all of a sudden.

00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:30.720
That's not it.

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:33.590
She just admires me for some reason.

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:35.490
Her again...

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:41.350
Dad, how's the water?

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:43.560
It's perfect.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.790
So, what now, Kitaro?

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:51.740
There's a rumor that children in the city
are disappearing one after another.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:55.010
It probably isn't worth our concern.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:56.600
Wait a minute, Kitaro.

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:57.850
Dad?

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:03.040
You shouldn't underestimate
rumors among children.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:07.790
Perhaps we should at least hear
what she has to say.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:12.280
Fine. If you insist, Dad.

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:14.410
Kitaro! Cat-san!

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:16.180
Cat-san?

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:20.410
Mana just started calling me that.
Don't mind it.

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:25.920
I see. So, over ten children
have gone missing.

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:26.810
Yes.

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:29.070
But, it's just a rumor, right?

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:34.170
I got reliable information by
checking forums and asking my friends!

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:41.560
Tell me, Mana-chan, why did you think
to gather this info in the first place?

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:47.020
Before, I didn't believe in
things I couldn't see at all.

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:52.780
But, after meeting Kitaro and Cat-san,
I realized that such a world exists.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:57.780
So, I thought maybe
I could help you guys...

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:02.040
I see. I appreciate the sentiment.

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:05.220
But, you should stop doing this.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:07.020
Why?

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:10.960
Now that we're friends,
I want to help out!

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:15.170
<i>Yokai</i> and humans can't be friends.

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:21.990
If you approach the world of <i>yokai</i>,
the <i>yokai</i> will approach you.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:27.600
But, usually the worlds of <i>yokai</i>
and humans don't mix.

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:30.860
They shouldn't mix.

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:37.550
Ghosts and <i>yokai</i> are better off
being feared at a distance.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:44.500
I owe you for saving me
and I'll make sure to check this out.

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:48.830
But, never get involved in
something like this again.

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:50.440
Got it?

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:58.070
I sense something.

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:01.220
But, it's pretty weak.

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:05.140
Twelve children have disappeared so far,

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:10.190
but, from across the city to near a river,
there's no correlation in location.

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:15.320
I guess it's just a rumor after all...

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:18.320
Just a second, Kitaro.

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:22.280
There's a common link to
all the places we've been!

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.120
A construction site.

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:26.620
Hold on.

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:29.560
You're right.

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:34.880
Every place with a rumor always has
some new building being built!

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:42.590
And so, this facility is
being constructed at a rapid pace.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:49.870
This track is scheduled to be used
for the opening ceremony.

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:59.090
What are those pillars for?

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:00.200
Pillars? Where?

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:03.490
There, in the middle of the track.

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:06.390
What? There's nothing there.

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:08.620
You're crazy, Inuyama!

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:11.420
<i>Nobody can see them?!</i>

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:14.170
I should tell Cat-san and Kitaro!

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:18.550
<i>Yokai</i> and humans can't be friends.

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:21.570
Never get involved in
something like this again.

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:23.120
Got it?

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:26.560
<i>If I'm uncertain,
I'll just cause trouble again.</i>

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:28.930
<i>I should investigate more first...</i>

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:38.110
Oh crap, oh crap, oh crap!
If I'm late I'll get yelled at again!

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.280
TANTANBO

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:52.330
At last, a full set.

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:55.670
This will be the last pillar.

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:58.630
So, you're the one kidnapping children.

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:00.380
You?!

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:03.880
Be careful, Kitaro. It's the Tantanbo!

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:06.240
Return the children you've kidnapped.

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:12.560
I cannot. We require 13 human sacrifices
for our objective!

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:18.710
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:25.640
He sank?!

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:43.650
Fool. Stay there as a stone forever.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:00.090
Oh, Kitaro. That was a deft dodge!

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:04.110
I had a bad feeling.
The way he made the road ripple...

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:08.530
He never had an ability
to control concrete before.

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:13.410
I wonder why the Tantanbo
emerged now of all times.

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:17.190
I thought he and the Futakuchi-Onna
and the Kamaitachi

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:20.780
were all sealed away in a stone
along with the Yokai Castle.

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:21.800
The Yokai Castle?

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:25.740
It's a castle they built
deep in the mountains a long time ago.

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:27.780
But, why...?

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:31.070
That's it! The construction sites.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:32.430
Could it be...?

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:47.470
One?

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:49.010
Help!

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:50.550
Help me!

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:52.600
Please!

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:54.270
Someone!

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:56.890
-Lemme out!
-Let me out!

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:01.090
Let me out! Please let me out!

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:02.920
Help me!

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:06.170
It's dark. I can't move... Mommy!

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:07.420
<i>People are...</i>

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:08.630
Please!

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:09.840
Let me out!

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:12.080
<i>They're trapped inside?!</i>

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:18.520
<i>"It looks like children are
trapped inside pillars."</i>

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:27.570
Well, well.
A young girl here by herself...

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:32.390
She looks juicy and yummy.
Maybe I'll eat her...

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:30.510
FUTAKUCHI-ONNA, KAMAITACHI

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:36.570
Wait, Futakuchi-Onna.

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:38.160
Don't get in my way!

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:43.040
This is perfect.
We need one more kid for the last pillar.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:45.000
Right, Tantanbo?

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:47.010
Right!

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:49.110
Very well.

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:55.290
<i>Kitaro!</i>

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:59.230
SEND

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:22.810
Hurry! The center of this incident
is probably...

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:24.460
Dad, look!

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:56.160
GEGEGE NO KITARO YOKAI CASTLE

00:11:56.930 --> 00:12:00.660
TANTANBO AND KITARO WITH HIS FRIENDS

00:11:58.720 --> 00:11:59.600
-<i>"Eek!"</i>
-<i>"What?"</i>

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:00.600
<i>"Scratch, scratch."</i>

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:06.670
The mountain where the Yokai Castle was
sealed was reduced to nothing by humans.

00:12:06.670 --> 00:12:10.170
Concrete is made by mixing
cement and gravel.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:12.110
Cement is made from limestone

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:15.680
and gravel is made by
breaking down mountain rocks.

00:12:16.030 --> 00:12:20.200
The stone that sealed the Yokai Castle
must have mixed with those materials.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:27.000
As a result, concrete containing their
shards were used in various constructions.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:34.090
That's why they can travel anywhere that
contains such shards and control them.

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:40.220
And the place where materials
were used the most is probably...

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:42.600
Kitaro!

00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:44.520
Look at this!

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:48.380
<i>It looks like the children
are being held in these pillars!</i>

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:51.320
<i>I had to know, so I came to check.</i>

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:53.300
<i>I'm sorry to break my promise.</i>

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:56.840
<i>But, please, you have to save everyone!!</i>

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:01.660
She's a good child.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:02.510
Yes.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.060
Hey!

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:09.410
You're gonna help, right?
We'll lend a hand.

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:12.860
We still owe that girl for saving you.

00:13:13.050 --> 00:13:15.290
Wally Wall.

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:16.590
Everyone...

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:20.350
Thank you. I'll need your help.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:23.430
It may hurt, but don't worry.

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:27.420
Inside those pillars,
you won't age or die.

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:31.550
You will support the Yokai Castle forever.

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:33.380
<i>Kitaro!</i>

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:34.440
Here goes!

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:37.280
You're here!

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:40.350
Watch it! What're you doin'?

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:42.310
Let's go, too!

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:46.100
Leave me be!

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:48.420
I'm gonna be sick!

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:50.060
Don't do that!

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:52.650
Too slow. This'll finish it!

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.070
Hair Needles!

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:58.890
Old Man Crybaby, take out that wall!

00:13:58.890 --> 00:13:59.990
Got it!

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:02.120
Anything to get down from here!

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:06.910
Now!

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:10.170
Wally Wall!

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:13.170
Good going! I'll kiss you later.

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:17.490
You're going nowhere!

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:24.330
Dammit!

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:26.890
Rollo Cloth, take care of him!

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.140
Cotton copies!

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:33.630
Be careful, Kitaro.

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:35.590
Yes, Dad.

00:14:42.550 --> 00:14:44.010
Hair Needles!

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:53.170
Paralysis Sand!

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:56.210
My body...!

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:02.570
Good going!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:05.290
That was easier than I--

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:10.500
Here goes!

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:13.150
That was easy.

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:16.150
What?!

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:20.200
You'll never defeat me like that!

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:24.490
-Owie!
-This is so easy my sickles are rusting!

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:27.120
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:29.240
Fool!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:33.350
So long as the Yokai Castle exists,
we are invincible!

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:41.740
Kitaro!

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:50.020
Hold on, Kitaro!

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:53.940
How pathetic, Kitaro.

00:15:54.670 --> 00:16:00.270
Tantanbo, what are you guys trying to do
by resurrecting the Yokai Castle?!

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:05.350
Let me ask you this.
Looking at this world, how do you feel?

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:10.680
After awakening from our long slumber,

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:16.730
we saw humans had polluted, twisted,
and wounded the world as they pleased.

00:16:17.070 --> 00:16:19.130
That's why I realized,

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:22.630
this world does not need humans after all!

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:28.100
This castle can absorb humans
and turn them into <i>yokai</i>.

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:31.530
Therefore, we decided that
we should use that power

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:35.100
and create a world of nothing but <i>yokai</i>!

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:38.870
You would exterminate the humans.
That's your objective?

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:39.920
Indeed!

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:45.360
We will show those humans
who would scorn and consume this world!

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:50.180
With the Yokai Castle, we can do that!

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:54.060
Humans dismiss that which they can't see.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:58.400
They no longer fear the dark
and have become arrogant.

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:00.880
I've been annoyed at them, too.

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:06.070
But, the moment you act like they do
and try to exterminate them,

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:09.390
you become no better...
no, you become worse than them.

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.390
Humans and <i>yokai</i>.

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:16.880
To assume only one should exist
is never right.

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:18.400
I...

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:25.650
I hate those who can't accept
others that are different from them!

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:27.870
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:30.830
Internal Electricity!

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:39.080
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:43.900
You got him?!

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:45.380
It's futile.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:50.140
So long as this castle exists,
we will continue to regenerate.

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:52.240
Not even Kitaro can beat them?!

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:55.480
There's no end to them reviving!

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:57.690
This is terrible!

00:17:57.690 --> 00:18:00.650
They're truly one with the castle!

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:09.110
One with the castle...

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:12.140
Catchick, call the girl's phone!

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.500
INCOMING CALL
CAT-SAN

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:25.470
Right there!

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.190
Hold on!

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:43.750
Kitaro...

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:45.820
I knew you'd come.

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:51.450
You dare!

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:55.450
That's it. They can't use
the castle's power anymore!

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:57.160
-Now!
-Right!

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:59.330
How dare you!

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:01.210
That's my line!

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:10.380
Wally Wall!

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.430
Kitaro!

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:27.030
Finger Guns!

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:31.430
Impossible...

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:34.430
How could we...

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:36.850
...lose...

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:47.480
They seem to be all right, physically.

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:51.030
We can leave the rest to
the human doctors.

00:19:51.030 --> 00:19:52.630
Thank goodness.

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:57.400
I'm sorry! You were right, Kitaro.

00:19:57.400 --> 00:20:02.600
I got involved where I shouldn't have
and ended up causing you trouble.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:05.380
Wait. Should she be apologizing?

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:09.130
I'm pretty sure it's thanks to Mana
that we beat them.

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:14.850
Besides, this is all because you pushed
her away with what you said, Kitaro.

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:16.810
I know that.

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:17.640
But...

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:21.500
Speak up. This is unlike you, Kitaro.

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:26.600
I was able to protect her this time.
But, what about next time?

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:33.070
That's why I didn't want her to
get involved with things from our world...

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:35.970
Wait a minute.

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:39.770
The fact that you feel that way
means you care about Mana.

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:46.210
I guess you already think of her
as a friend, don't you, Kitaro?

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:48.210
That's...

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:51.790
Listen, Kitaro.

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:56.530
For <i>yokai</i> and humans, beings from
different worlds, to live together,

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:59.280
what do you think is
the most important thing?

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:05.250
It's to respect and
to try to understand each other.

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:12.600
Um, I'd like to know more about <i>yokai</i>
and about you, too, Kitaro!

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:16.530
I know I'm a bother,
but, will you be my friend?!

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:25.600
Oh very well...

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:31.090
If I don't keep my eye on you,
you're likely to get in more trouble.

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:36.110
Mana.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:45.790
Still, it's curious.

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:47.220
What is?

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:49.410
The arrow you were shot with

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:53.460
and the sorcery that was used to
resurrect the Yokai Castle.

00:21:53.900 --> 00:21:58.320
We have no idea who's doing it
or for what purpose yet,

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.870
but here's hoping things don't get ugly.

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:07.460
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:07.460
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:08.830
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:08.830
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:08.960 --> 00:22:11.500
<i>Oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:08.960 --> 00:22:11.500
<i>oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:11.630 --> 00:22:16.510
<i>Perhaps the truth lies
In what you can't see</i>

00:22:11.630 --> 00:22:16.510
<i>mienaimono ni koso shinjitsu ga
arukamo nante</i>

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:19.390
<i>Do you believe that?
If you close your eyes</i>

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:19.390
<i>kimi wa shinjirukana? me wo tojireba</i>

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:23.970
<i>A new story will begin</i>

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:23.970
<i>hajimaruyo atarashii monogatari</i>

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:30.230
<i>The really important things</i>

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:30.230
<i>taisetsu na mono wa itsudatte</i>

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:35.030
<i>Are always things you can't see</i>

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:35.030
<i>me niwa mienai monosa</i>

00:22:35.150 --> 00:22:37.860
<i>Looking up to a nameless sky</i>

00:22:35.150 --> 00:22:37.860
<i>namae no nai sora wo miage</i>

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:40.990
<i>I bittersweetly counted dreams</i>

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:40.990
<i>hiki komogomo yume wo kazoeta</i>

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:43.620
<i>Are you honest with yourself?</i>

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:43.620
<i>kimi wa jibun ni shoujikikai?</i>

00:22:43.950 --> 00:22:48.540
<i>The wind tickled my nose</i>

00:22:43.950 --> 00:22:48.540
<i>kaze ga hana wo kusugutta</i>

00:22:48.920 --> 00:22:51.590
<i>Lost in the dark night, oeoeo</i>

00:22:48.920 --> 00:22:51.590
<i>yamiyo ni magirete oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:54.340
<i>Oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:54.340
<i>oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.460 --> 00:22:56.800
<i>From behind you, oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.460 --> 00:22:56.800
<i>kimi no ushiro kara oeoeo</i>

00:22:56.920 --> 00:23:01.720
<i>Oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:22:56.920 --> 00:23:01.720
<i>oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:23:06.060 --> 00:23:09.350
<i>Dad, a human child is coming to
the GeGeGe Forest?</i>

00:23:09.480 --> 00:23:11.610
<i>Huh? I have to guide him?!</i>

00:23:12.520 --> 00:23:14.820
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:14.940 --> 00:23:16.860
<i>"The Taboo of The Mysterious Forest"</i>

00:23:16.990 --> 00:23:19.700
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
